@startuml CU-18
actor "Encargado de sucursal" as Stf
boundary "«UI» Angular (gestión de reservas)" as UI
control "«Controller» API /reservations" as Ctrl
entity "«Model» ReservationService / Reservation / Inventory" as Model

Stf -> UI : 1: consultar reservas de la sucursal
UI -> Ctrl : 2: GET /reservations?status=
Ctrl -> Model : 3: list_staff(db, user, status?)
Model --> Ctrl : 4: list[ReservationRead]
Ctrl --> UI : 5: list[ReservationRead]
UI --> Stf : 6: reservas mostradas

Stf -> UI : 7: preparar prendas de una reserva
UI -> Ctrl : 8: PATCH /reservations/{id}/status (PREPARED)
Ctrl -> Model : 9: transition(PENDING → PREPARED)
Model --> Ctrl : 10: ReservationRead (PREPARED)
Ctrl --> UI : 11: ReservationRead
UI --> Stf : 12: prendas preparadas

@enduml